在 Miz Jeannie 上规划今天 → (https://mizjeannie.com/almanac)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for October 25, 2026. Color: Orange — confidence, creativity, success, opportunity. Crystal: Citrine — prosperity, clarity, confidence, success. Herb: Basil (Ocimum basilicum) — prosperity, protection, love, success. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6addd4cc5dcc3.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:07:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>昨晚在Society Garden欣赏了一场很棒的演唱会，演出乐队叫&lt;a href="https://jeremywouldletmedrown.com"&gt;Jeremy Would Let Me Drown&lt;/a&gt;。他们翻唱了一些我最喜欢的垃圾摇滚乐队，包括Pearl Jam、Soundgarden和Alice in Chains。</title><link>https://some.pics/6addccf1123f9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;昨晚在Society Garden欣赏了一场很棒的演唱会，演出乐队叫&lt;a href="https://jeremywouldletmedrown.com"&gt;Jeremy Would Let Me Drown&lt;/a&gt;。他们翻唱了一些我最喜欢的垃圾摇滚乐队，包括Pearl Jam、Soundgarden和Alice in Chains。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A nighttime outdoor concert at Society Garden, with a live band performing on a brightly lit stage surrounded by warm string lights. Large trees frame the venue, while people sit at picnic tables and gather around the open-air space to enjoy the music." height="2268" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6addccf1123f9.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:33:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>陪丈夫拼生日南瓜拼图</title><link>https://some.pics/6addb3d62db84</link><description>&lt;p&gt;目前。我们开始拼我买给丈夫作生日礼物的Magic Puzzle Company拼图了。🎃&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Overhead shot of a puzzle table filled with a bunch of puzzle pieces not yet completed" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jezlyn/6addb3d62db84.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jezlyn.some.pics"&gt;@jezlyn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:46:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>我们又一次穿越了时空。</title><link>https://some.pics/6addaddca5d25</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们又一次穿越了时空。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A selfie showing a t-shirt labelled &amp;quot;let's do the time warp again&amp;quot; surrounded by different pictures of time traveling topics from pop culture" height="3032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jsanz/6addaddca5d25.jpg" width="2278"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jsanz.some.pics"&gt;@jsanz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 07:21:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>膝上猫</title><link>https://some.pics/6adda2798bf30</link><description>&lt;p&gt;膝上猫&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Tiny tuxedo cat curled up in my lap on my floooooooofy blanket" height="2938" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6adda2798bf30.jpg" width="2938"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:32:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>戴头巾眼镜刘海女子与数字花卉</title><link>https://some.pics/6add8708e51c6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;戴眼镜、留刘海、戴头巾的女子，背景是经过数字处理的花朵

（经数字修改的石墨铅笔画与摄影合成作品）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="woman in glasses with bangs wearing a head covering behind a background of digitally altered flowers" height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/untilted/6add8708e51c6.png" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://untilted.some.pics"&gt;@untilted&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:35:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在我们家附近一个温馨的小啤酒花园兼演出场地Society Garden，有一组散发着橙色光芒的南瓜灯。</title><link>https://some.pics/6add733097a14</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在我们家附近一个温馨的小啤酒花园兼演出场地Society Garden，有一组散发着橙色光芒的南瓜灯。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A group of glowing orange jack-o’-lantern decorations in various sizes arranged on the ground at night, with blue accent lighting illuminating the surrounding foliage." height="2268" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6add733097a14.jpg" width="3402"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:10:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>护身符制作可随时暂停</title><link>https://some.pics/6add6dc082a0b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;护身符不必一次做完。如果你打结或缝小袋累了，可以把它收起来，以后再继续。休息一下并不会让你已经倾注的用心白费。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-black and muted rose-pink storybook scene of a witch tending an unfinished knotted charm in a shallow basket inside a cream nautilus-shell home. A cushioned chair sits beside a sea-facing window with lantern boats and towering shells beyond. Warm ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: A charm doesn't have to be finished in one sitting. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6add6dc082a0b.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:47:31 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>